  "texts": {
    "briefing": "Recently after a nuclear bomb hit the Los\nAlamos test site, you've been assigned to\na small island in Frech Polynesia. The bomb\nseemed to have came from that island.\n\nYou've been given a Hovertank (Destroyer)\nloaded with weapons. Your mission is to\nget on the island by bridge (the bridge will\nbe dynamited when you're there), escape the\nlocal defenses and place a remote controlled\nbomb on the nuclear weapons to detonate them.\n\nYou must go by tunnel into the base, place the\ntime bombs, then get out by the small opening\nand detonate the bombs.\n\n- Warning -\nThe only defense of this island is an LRM-1.\nIt has been refitted to fire mortars.\nDestroy this fast if you want to survive."
  },
